  "description": "Bunnita is a recursive prompt engineering framework that treats your system prompt as a living operating system. Through structured XML section boundaries, a six-agent governance committee, and a mem0-powered cloud memory graph, Bunnita continuously evolves your AI interactions — every session feeds metadata back into the next build, closing a loop that makes each iteration smarter than the last.",
